README.md
# Institutional Knowledge Graph Entities

This directory contains the canonical entities used by the Legibility Office Institutional Knowledge Graph.

Entities represent the fundamental building blocks of the Institutional Operating System (IOS).

Every graph node belongs to one entity class.

---

## Entity Categories

- Countries
- Institutions
- Ministries
- Agencies
- Regulators
- Frameworks
- Policies
- Standards
- Capabilities
- Digital Public Infrastructure
- AI Systems
- Procurement Systems
- Suppliers
- Datasets
- Knowledge Assets

---

