The entities/ directory is your repository's semantic vocabulary. Every node in the knowledge graph should come from this canonical library, ensuring consistency across APIs, datasets, and analytics.

The resulting architecture is:

Ontology
    │
    ▼
Entities
    │
    ▼
Relationships
    │
    ▼
Knowledge Graph
    │
    ▼
Institutional Intelligence

By separating entities from relationships and schemas, you've established a scalable semantic layer that can grow from a handful of institutions to continent-wide governance ecosystems without changing the underlying model.
